    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 170,
        "text": "Hi Lina, thanks for coming in. We need to finalize the report on the customer satisfaction survey. Did you compare the results from this quarter with the previous one?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "322d27dd40b1c155bbe54ad7513d8f911fe61930babf9e6b11a6909828ebd26d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 174,
        "sourceEnd": 307,
        "text": "Yes, I did. The overall satisfaction score is 4.2 out of 5 this quarter, compared to 3.8 last quarter. That's a significant increase.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "bfed3916429dd581945c8ed83542082b2af573408e6911ea77696a4d67cf12b9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 311,
        "sourceEnd": 387,
        "text": "Good. And how about the number of respondents? Was it larger than last time?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "97bab375d77d5e7cc6a8eac948c74662c53242bff2fe10472f8d1bcd07227389",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 391,
        "sourceEnd": 556,
        "text": "Actually, it was slightly smaller. We had 480 respondents this quarter, whereas last quarter we had 520. So, fewer people took part, but the satisfaction was higher.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "6a6ad5ce2152e64c69cb62b3667835a160372867d7cbdf7fabda89a3cd8f12e5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 560,
        "sourceEnd": 642,
        "text": "Interesting. What about the age groups? Did younger customers respond differently?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "702fb2f0431d18dae23fd4c5b97c5434d067f500a511464420751a9e44fb5a6a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 646,
        "sourceEnd": 873,
        "text": "Yes, they did. The 18-30 age group gave an average score of 4.5, which is higher than the overall average. The 31-45 group gave 4.0, and the 46+ group gave 3.9. So, the younger the customers, the more satisfied they seem to be.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "645d1aa6c1a39e22d42e3d685fe9ce5f31de6ea6cbd06fafe9f5fe816694e69d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 877,
        "sourceEnd": 977,
        "text": "That's a clear trend. Now, regarding the product features, which aspect received the highest rating?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "308cde9ad1fd63151369cb5bd431d24ae3708fe94743743901071891688a4e1d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 981,
        "sourceEnd": 1116,
        "text": "The ease of use got the top rating, with an average of 4.7. The next highest was customer support at 4.3. The lowest was price, at 3.5.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "52552e355f20d7d705e90efc0a6c0a50c8178342f64966feddd4730a0c66c4ce",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1120,
        "sourceEnd": 1210,
        "text": "So, price is still a concern. Did we ask about the likelihood of recommending our product?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "6583010e08d333131581d1b56d878888c4d226cbb3b1721d633ec1edc335c918",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1214,
        "sourceEnd": 1331,
        "text": "Yes, we did. The Net Promoter Score, or NPS, was 32 this quarter, up from 25 last quarter. That's a good improvement.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "88153738b8b33192b301a72a6ed0634f8af11283bad475e3f80d9241ba1d94ea",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1335,
        "sourceEnd": 1441,
        "text": "Definitely. Now, for the report, we need to highlight the key findings. Can you summarize the main points?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "72db3e3ad0a1b427b4a7591b61ff23dd15cc84f1f8a137fdb99f4ffe1477c53f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1445,
        "sourceEnd": 1626,
        "text": "Sure. Satisfaction increased, especially among younger customers. Ease of use is our strongest feature, while price remains the weakest. And more people are willing to recommend us.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "1a4b226b60e71c9a187b9994240fbaf974b82188e50c3885eea8c78b15908273",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1630,
        "sourceEnd": 1746,
        "text": "Perfect. Let's also note that the sample size was smaller this quarter, so we should be cautious about generalizing.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "82a6a7312547db3bd1d97d4d9df378f04352a453fd7d126a489e71e8f69363a0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1750,
        "sourceEnd": 1812,
        "text": "Agreed. I'll add a note about that in the limitations section.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "38f5f85363fe235647c9a76c54195649b0b0eaf95dc81f10cd7d6d22c3b168bf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
